MODRELOAD

The specified module is unloaded and then reloaded.
Useful for applying changes without restarting the server.

-- Reload a module into the ircd
the optional path can be an absolute path
from / or from the IRCD_PREFIX
(ie modules/autoload/m_users.so)

- Requires Oper Priv: A

Syntax: MODRELOAD <[path/]module.so>

